cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, with the exact commit you used, and cite the
  original publication of every criterion you report (see METHODS.md).
type: software
title: "multifat: a traceable library of multiaxial fatigue criteria"
abstract: >-
  Published multiaxial high-cycle fatigue criteria (critical-plane, invariant, integral and
  energy-based), each checked against its original publication, evaluated on common experimental
  datasets through a one-command pipeline. Developed within FABER COST Action Working Group 4.3.
authors:
  - family-names: Chiocca
    given-names: Andrea
  - family-names: Grossi
    given-names: Tommaso
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/andreachiocca/multiaxial-fatigue"
keywords:
  - multiaxial fatigue
  - high-cycle fatigue
  - critical plane
  - fatigue criteria
  - mechanical engineering
